# Import Rules

## ALWAYS Use Absolute Package Imports

```dart
// GOOD - absolute package imports
import 'package:riverpod_template/presentation/login/login_view.dart';
import 'package:riverpod_template/data/repositories/auth_repository/auth_repository.dart';

// NEVER - relative imports
import '../login/login_view.dart';
import './auth_repository.dart';
```

## Import Order

1. Dart core
2. Flutter
3. Third-party packages
4. Project imports: `package:riverpod_template/...`

## No Barrel Exports

Do not use barrel files that re-export everything. Import each file directly.
